00:13:27,516 --> 00:13:34,016
あ、これさ、あ、団長ね、20秒と言わず、何秒でもできるよ。よしよし、いきますね。
Ah, this, well, Danchou can do it not just for 20 seconds, but any amount of time. Alright, here we go.

150
00:13:34,816 --> 00:13:39,016
