Alright. Alright, I'll do it. You see, management tried to expose some cheating just now, but Danchou is going to ignore it.

155
00:14:18,516 --> 00:14:22,016
空気椅子ってどんな感じなのだろう？ちょっとやってみます。これこうして
What does an air chair feel like? Let's try it. Like this...

156
00:14:22,516 --> 00:14:28,016
こうか？こういうこと？あ、ちょっと待って、ほい。はい、あ、秒数。
Like this? Is this it? Ah, wait, ho. Yes, ah, counting seconds.

157
00:14:29,016 --> 00:14:44,016
ええと、1、2、3、4、5、6、7、8、9、もっと深く！づあっ！
Uh, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8, 9, deeper! Zua!

158
00:14:45,016 --> 00:14:59,016
あ、で、これ確かにこう言うこと？あ、優雅に。で、11、12、13、14、もっと、15、16、17、18、19、え、待って、もっと深くっ！
Ah, and this is really what it means? Ah, gracefully. Then 11, 12, 13, 14, more, 15, 16, 17, 18, 19... wait, even deeper!

